                      ShowDoors v0.1 coded by CøRteX/tRS¿
                     -===================================-

. [ INTRUDUCTION: ] .
---------------------

   This is .REALLY. a must for every Boardsystems!! so their users can
   see what doors they can use!
   Off course with seperate menus for SYSOPs and normal Users!!!

. [ Requirements: ] . 
---------------------

   All what you need is any Model of an Amiga OS2.0 or higher!
   AmiExpress 2.xx - 3.xx
   Thats all folks....

. [ INSTALLATION ] .
--------------------
   Copy the files in the archive to your directories,
   they are :                                        
                                                  
   BBS:Doors/ShowDoors/ShowDoors.XiM
   BBS:Doors/ShowDoors/SysopMenu.txt              
   BBS:Doors/ShowDoors/UserMenu.txt
   BBS:Doors/ShowDoors/ShowDoors.txt
   LIBS:AEDoor.library ( © Sintax/WOT )


   All Users under SecLevel=250 will see the UserDoors.txt and of course
   the Rest (over 250) will see the SysopDoors.txt!
   thats it..... have fun!!!

. [HISTORY: ] .
---------------
                     V0.1    -  First release

